    "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/c514daf17eda5904c55db0618c6e6a53.avif?t=1707442686\" /></span><br>This game is in the public testing stage and we will actively listen to the opinions of players for improvement and refinement game.<br>If you like this game,please add wishlist!Thank you for your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In &quot;Fireworks Mode&quot;, players can use fireworks to bless each other and cooperate to repel various invading &quot;monsters&quot; (Nian Beasts). The player with the highest score ultimately wins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In racing mode, players can compete with friends to see who has the best driving skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the same time, the game also retains a social racing game mode, with the Chinese &quot;Sanxingdui&quot; as the element of obstacles on the map. Through layers of levels, see who can reach the finish line first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Spring Festival is approaching, and in the newly added &quot;fireworks mode&quot;, Chinese style fireworks blessings can be released, and friends can be invited to go online and set off fireworks together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/ea06bcd4a80e18e6d13d748ff7c78731.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In &quot;Fireworks Mode&quot;, players can use fireworks to bless each other and cooperate to repel various invading &quot;monsters&quot; (Nian Beasts). The player with the highest score ultimately wins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/8b3b7e222003977404b923487aea95cc.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In racing mode, players can compete with friends to see who has the best driving skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/e638118da29075014e37413f454366ba.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the same time, the game also retains a social racing game mode, with the Chinese &quot;Sanxingdui&quot; as the element of obstacles on the map. Through layers of levels, see who can reach the finish line first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/097b416917149dc3c164f637d8ad58f3.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Spring Festival is approaching, and in the newly added &quot;fireworks mode&quot;, Chinese style fireworks blessings can be released, and friends can be invited to go online and set off fireworks together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.poster.avif?t=1707442686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.webm?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470330/extras/1a0f337a0d50f3cf40e8ac1596650cbd.mp4?t=1707442686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
